        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"fc017556-bc72-4933-b48d-5ec067204dd8\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is the best way to grow your music library,I love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"353595ac-ad0e-42ae-8d3e-d92e0911fcca\",\"review_text\":\"Yes gud\"},{\"review_id\":\"b48769c8-e1fd-4ecf-8250-a0194586449f\",\"review_text\":\"I use it all day , great app\"},{\"review_id\":\"8757ae6b-e25f-4275-8437-493df20f0719\",\"review_text\":\"This was one of the best app but after update i uninstall it due to forced premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"e89ab35c-23c7-424b-baf8-289d143e3541\",\"review_text\":\"Da mour dee kous\"},{\"review_id\":\"94dfde2f-2a0a-48e2-8c01-ff60753f1bce\",\"review_text\":\"the app is really good get any audio book any songs any languages are recommended this app really good love you spotify, ❤️❤️😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"a14bdadf-94db-453d-96a7-180d22562f53\",\"review_text\":\"Really good and my son really enjoys the experience and everything ☺️\"},{\"review_id\":\"39764e4d-eea8-4ff4-a42f-2bd61d1a107a\",\"review_text\":\"Ok so first off I (with many others) LOVED Spotify as it had so many cool features and I was a person who literally never cared about ads because we all have to make money but even with the recent update I was chill about shuffle but THE NO GOING BACK AND THE LYRICS THING......NO!!! I MEAN IF THESE TWO THINGS ARE CHANGED I BET YOU NO ONE WILL BE COMPLAINING\"},{\"review_id\":\"4f0e0a73-72bc-43d5-8067-de6c4338665b\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify keeps stoping songs in the middle when listening through bluetooth\"},{\"review_id\":\"b6749868-bfc5-4c7f-98d7-68c82dde49af\",\"review_text\":\"So far, I love this app. Playing my old favorites bring back great memories!\"}]}"
